71146596128194_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YNnaaqEPvPkQ7kNvwFJBJZR&_nc_oc=Adp06vcoSZcKMnAQEOl4jJUAQxyTwoNZlrSudPct7u7UjhRd-RDzh0sUcxWxjEVP4Yo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRGhbEEPDOiHn5HU7vqZOkF5y-3XQVZFALytU1pyGSuRw&oe=6AE73A39"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "2116332565928774", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622315_2116332569262107_6472776043868426897_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hJRx_c0VZPEQ7kNvwEGJi-8&_nc_oc=AdoppIVoSimaZIOpyiHU3GNMsY2TXYuvd5a3e-r09kl-BRWmNrlAN8Rs3lW1s-d1vAw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQn5XlKmC1oes2uqfFjChyocyIctjPlIeGLedVMWUdAQg&oe=6AE74D13"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "909457358817429", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623558_909457362150762_5574869297430657880_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=x6ZmGX3WVekQ7kNvwHZDwgN&_nc_oc=AdrGRU-5Ku0_AgWzmzTMIp9FZDQRYSWihmdJ_LJz-zAiTjbo1954S2YrXPKx2S5oBGA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTu2J44oWsv8looHJR-iTfCm-4Iwv_hY3D8jIn1MiDRYQ&oe=6AE74B5A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Wild", "keywords": ["social", "free", "hangout", "friends", "chat"], "long_description": "**Explore with friends.**\n\nWild is one big social space. Walk across the map, follow the noise, visit other players, or let your curiosity lead the way.\n\n**Life as a duck.**\n\nCustomize your duck avatar, and express yourself in ways only possible inside VR. Walk, run, or jump around with hand-based movement.\n\n**Welcome to the community.**\n\nWhen you join Wild, you\u2019re joining a new world that is constantly changing. Tune into events, changes to the map, or try out the latest cosmetics.\n", "short_description": "Wild is a social VR hangout world. Explore a shared city, meet friends, and host events."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https: